      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As you already guessed, there is no support for gestures on generic avatars.\n\nHonestly right now the only variables that actually work in generic controllers are the movementx and movementz variables (the groung variable works too, but only localside, at least the last time i tried it)\n\nWould be awesome (and not too complicated) to have at least the gesture variable available.",
